{"id":"bc0d9cb665f96790","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-ind.md","title":"归纳定义复杂度 IND","display":"df-ind — 归纳定义复杂度 IND","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-ind","aliases":["29-df-ind"],"display":"df-ind — 归纳定义复杂度 IND","depends_on":["[[29-df-fo-lfp]]","[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-positivity]]","[[29-df-inductive-depth]]","[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","[[29-df-free-variable]]","[[29-df-term]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 4.16, p.62, DjVu scan 77","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-ind"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-ind</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ind — 归纳定义复杂度 IND"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d8799e17a4ba0440\" href=\"?note=d8799e17a4ba0440\" title=\"29-df-fo-lfp\">29-df-fo-lfp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0d59539a54286933\" href=\"?note=0d59539a54286933\" title=\"29-df-positivity\">29-df-positivity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3f8441c5cf2fdcc5\" href=\"?note=3f8441c5cf2fdcc5\" title=\"29-df-inductive-depth\">29-df-inductive-depth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"575d9a1532e3c73b\" href=\"?note=575d9a1532e3c73b\" title=\"29-df-term\">29-df-term</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 4.16, p.62, DjVu scan 77"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限词汇。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下面的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{(k)}\\notin\\tau\">\\(R^{(k)}\\notin\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>、不同变量组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\">\\(\\bar x\\)</span> 和项组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau^k\">\\(\\bar u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau^k\\)</span> 遍历所有合法取值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}_\\tau(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{depth}_\\tau(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3f8441c5cf2fdcc5\" href=\"?note=3f8441c5cf2fdcc5\" title=\"29-df-inductive-depth\">29-df-inductive-depth</a>；绑定关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 和变量组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\">\\(\\bar x\\)</span> 是资源签名的必要参数。语义取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d8799e17a4ba0440\" href=\"?note=d8799e17a4ba0440\" title=\"29-df-fo-lfp\">29-df-fo-lfp</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H\">\\(\\mathcal H\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}}[\\tau])\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}}[\\tau])\\)</span> 内变化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span> 含 LFP 的绑定子句。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 取有限非空模型；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IND}\">\\(\\mathrm{IND}\\)</span> 在 Assertion 中定义为布尔查询集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 为可选的明确输入论域；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}_A(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{depth}_A(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3f8441c5cf2fdcc5\" href=\"?note=3f8441c5cf2fdcc5\" title=\"29-df-inductive-depth\">29-df-inductive-depth</a> 对所有固定参数赋值取最大值的深度。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_t[\\tau;\\mathcal D]\">\\(\\mathcal H_t[\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\)</span> 沿用下式相同的 FO 语法闭包，但只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> 上要求资源界。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_t[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{[\\operatorname{LFP}_{R,\\bar x}\\varphi](\\bar u)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\{R\\}},\\ \\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\varphi),\\ \\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\operatorname{depth}_\\tau(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)\\leq c\\,t(n)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal B_t[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{[\\operatorname{LFP}_{R,\\bar x}\\varphi](\\bar u)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\{R\\}},\\ \\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\varphi),\\ \\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\operatorname{depth}_\\tau(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)\\leq c\\,t(n)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_t[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\cup\\mathcal B_t[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathcal H\\ \\land\\ \\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;(\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\land\\psi,\\exists x\\,\\phi)\\in\\mathcal H^3\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal H_t[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\cup\\mathcal B_t[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathcal H\\ \\land\\ \\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;(\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\land\\psi,\\exists x\\,\\phi)\\in\\mathcal H^3\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathcal H_t[\\tau],\\ \\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathcal H_t[\\tau],\\ \\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{depth}_{\\tau,\\mathcal D}(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)\\coloneqq\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{depth}_A(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\\mid A\\in\\mathcal D\\land\\operatorname{card}(|A|)=n\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{depth}_{\\tau,\\mathcal D}(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)\\coloneqq\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{depth}_A(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\\mid A\\in\\mathcal D\\land\\operatorname{card}(|A|)=n\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_t[\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\{[\\operatorname{LFP}_{R,\\bar x}\\varphi](\\bar u)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\{R\\}},\\ \\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\varphi),\\ \\exists c\\geq1\\;\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\operatorname{depth}_{\\tau,\\mathcal D}(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)\\leq c\\,t(n)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal B_t[\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\{[\\operatorname{LFP}_{R,\\bar x}\\varphi](\\bar u)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\{R\\}},\\ \\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\varphi),\\ \\exists c\\geq1\\;\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\operatorname{depth}_{\\tau,\\mathcal D}(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)\\leq c\\,t(n)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_t[\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\cup\\mathcal B_t[\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\subseteq\\mathcal H\\land\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;(\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\land\\psi,\\exists x\\,\\phi)\\in\\mathcal H^3\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal H_t[\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\cup\\mathcal B_t[\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\subseteq\\mathcal H\\land\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;(\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\land\\psi,\\exists x\\,\\phi)\\in\\mathcal H^3\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\{\\{A\\in\\mathcal D\\mid A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathcal H_t[\\tau;\\mathcal D],\\ \\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\{\\{A\\in\\mathcal D\\mid A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathcal H_t[\\tau;\\mathcal D],\\ \\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\tau;\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]]=\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\tau;\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]]=\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 4.16，印刷页 62，扫描页 77。资源界为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(t(n))\">\\(O(t(n))\\)</span>，并保留 FO 构造和合法 LFP 应用；不要求词汇中预先存在闭项。旧定义只枚举一个已固定的体和闭项元组，会使没有常量的关系词汇失去应有的查询。这里取各个 FO 体的统一深度界，不把任意嵌套 LFP 体不计成本地混入资源类。</p>\n<p>可选论域参数是本轮补充的显式接口，用于原书内建数值关系的合法输入约定。不能在标准 BIT 输入上证明了资源界，却未经论证要求同一程序在任意伪 BIT 结构上具有相同深度；反之也不能把任意结构上的旧默认界偷偷替换成标准数值界。空大小纤维取零，非空时深度值落在有限整数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\ldots,n^k\">\\(0,\\ldots,n^k\\)</span> 中，最大值存在。默认接口完整保留。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-fo-lfp","status":"resolved","id":"d8799e17a4ba0440","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-lfp]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-positivity","status":"resolved","id":"0d59539a54286933","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-positivity]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-inductive-depth","status":"resolved","id":"3f8441c5cf2fdcc5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-inductive-depth]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"db2b32546860e623","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"575d9a1532e3c73b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-inductive-depth","status":"resolved","id":"3f8441c5cf2fdcc5","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{depth}_\\tau(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)$ 见 [[29-df-inductive-depth]]；绑定关系 $R$ 和变量组 $\\bar x$ 是资源签名的必要参数。语义取 [[29-df-fo-lfp]] 的 $\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}$。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-lfp","status":"resolved","id":"d8799e17a4ba0440","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{depth}_\\tau(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)$ 见 [[29-df-inductive-depth]]；绑定关系 $R$ 和变量组 $\\bar x$ 是资源签名的必要参数。语义取 [[29-df-fo-lfp]] 的 $\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}$。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-inductive-depth","status":"resolved","id":"3f8441c5cf2fdcc5","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]$ 为可选的明确输入论域；$\\operatorname{depth}_A(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)$ 使用 [[29-df-inductive-depth]] 对所有固定参数赋值取最大值的深度。$\\mathcal H_t[\\tau;\\mathcal D]$ 沿用下式相同的 FO 语法闭包，但只在 $\\mathcal D$ 上要求资源界。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"R^{(k)}\\notin\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar x","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_\\tau^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{depth}_\\tau(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar x","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}}[\\tau])","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IND}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{depth}_A(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_t[\\tau;\\mathcal D]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_t[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{[\\operatorname{LFP}_{R,\\bar x}\\varphi](\\bar u)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\{R\\}},\\ \\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\varphi),\\ \\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\operatorname{depth}_\\tau(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)\\leq c\\,t(n)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_t[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\cup\\mathcal B_t[\\tau]\\subseteq\\mathcal H\\ \\land\\ \\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;(\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\land\\psi,\\exists x\\,\\phi)\\in\\mathcal H^3\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathcal H_t[\\tau],\\ \\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{depth}_{\\tau,\\mathcal D}(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)\\coloneqq\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{depth}_A(R,\\bar x;\\varphi)\\mid A\\in\\mathcal D\\land\\operatorname{card}(|A|)=n\\}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_t[\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\{[\\operatorname{LFP}_{R,\\bar x}\\varphi](\\bar u)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\{R\\}},\\ \\operatorname{Pos}_R(\\varphi),\\ \\exists c\\geq1\\;\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\operatorname{depth}_{\\tau,\\mathcal D}(R,\\bar x;\\varphi,n)\\leq c\\,t(n)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_t[\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}}[\\tau]\\mid\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\cup\\mathcal B_t[\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\subseteq\\mathcal H\\land\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;(\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\land\\psi,\\exists x\\,\\phi)\\in\\mathcal H^3\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\{\\{A\\in\\mathcal D\\mid A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathcal H_t[\\tau;\\mathcal D],\\ \\mathrm{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\tau;\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]]=\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\tau].","display":true},{"tex":"O(t(n))","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\ldots,n^k","display":false}],"bytes":4113,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-cram]]、[[29-df-ind]]、[[29-thm-cram-ind-fo]] — CRAM 与有界归纳深度"},{"id":"1e73231d304a46ec","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CRAM}[T,p,w]$ 使用 [[29-df-cram]] 的固定有限程序、同步优先写入、字长与全判定约定；$\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\tau;\\mathcal D]$ 见 [[29-df-ind]]。"},{"id":"23a5bfb89bfd12b0","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n$ 为结构域大小；$\\mathrm{IND}[n\\mapsto n^k,\\tau\\cup\\{<\\}]$ 按 [[29-df-ind]] 定义，限制到有序输入后与计算类比较。"},{"id":"4ff4df70f0b21aee","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CRAM}[T,p,w]$ 见 [[29-df-cram]]；$\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\sigma;\\mathcal D]$ 见 [[29-df-ind]]。"},{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-ind]]"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-ind]]"}],"outgoing":["d8799e17a4ba0440","a3fa1d78e657e6a2","0d59539a54286933","3f8441c5cf2fdcc5","b89b00b2e37a4ae5","db2b32546860e623","575d9a1532e3c73b"]}